            "notes": "This round I go  [Early Detonation](item_9e8a8aad-96a1-4068-994c-be0d3750469b) since we are already blowing the dynamite up over the enemy team, this allows us to do it more often.\n\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is usually my go to by this point to help negate the enemy teams healing.\n\nYou could also go  [Infrared Lenses](item_f19df350-745e-4e97-a495-8036b0be1262) for more damage if you're hitting a lot of shots or  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) for quicker B.O.B.s\n\n [Skyline Nanites](item_0b334927-da04-42d6-8dfd-96e7b6c1cd51) is nice if they have a lot of enemies staying in the air a lot.",
